---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cum Lucrăm"
  description="Procesul nostru în 3 pași: consultanță, testare, achiziție. Pentru companii care investesc în echipele lor."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="py-24 bg-yp-black border-b border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-yp-yellow/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
      <h1
        class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-white mb-6"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Partenerul de încredere<br />pentru echipe care construiesc viitorul
      </h1>
      <div
        class="w-12 h-1 bg-yp-yellow mx-auto mb-10"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
      </div>
      <p
        class="text-base lg:text-lg text-neutral-300 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        Nu oferim doar echipamente de protecție — creăm soluții complete pentru
        companii care își respectă angajații și înțeleg că siguranța și imaginea
        sunt investiții, nu cheltuieli.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Client Profile Section (Filter Logic) -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-[#0a0a0a] border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-white mb-6 leading-tight text-center"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Cu cine lucrăm cel mai bine
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-12 h-1 bg-yp-yellow mx-auto mb-6"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
      </div>
      <p
        class="text-center text-neutral-400 mb-16 text-base lg:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        Suntem parteneri pentru companii care se recunosc în aceste
        caracteristici:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <!-- Card 1: Company Size & Culture -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-6"
          >
            01 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white mb-6">
            Companii cu viziune
          </h3>
          <ul
            class="space-y-4 text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>15–40+ angajați (echipe stabile, decizii rapide)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Caută sistem și predictibilitate, nu improvizație</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Văd echipamentele ca investiție pe termen lung</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Industries -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-6"
          >
            02 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white mb-6">Industrii tehnice</h3>
          <ul
            class="space-y-4 text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Construcții și lucrări de instalații</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Producție, ateliere și fabrici</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Service auto, agricultură, transport</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Leadership Values -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="300"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-6"
          >
            03 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white mb-6">Lideri asumați</h3>
          <ul
            class="space-y-4 text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Calitatea = investiție, nu cheltuială</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Imagine profesională = prioritate strategică</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="text-yp-yellow mt-0.5">●</span>
              <span>Apreciază consultanță, nu doar cele mai ieftine oferte</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-16 p-8 bg-yp-black border border-white/10 rounded-[4px] max-w-3xl mx-auto flex items-start gap-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="400"
      >
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-yp-yellow"></div>
        <svg
          class="w-8 h-8 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-1"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white font-medium block mb-2">Important</strong> Dacă
          echipa ta are sub 15 angajați sau cauți doar cele mai ieftine prețuri fără
          consultanță, e posibil ca noi să nu fim partenerul potrivit pentru tine
          — și asta e OK. Preferăm să lucrăm cu clienți unde putem aduce cu adevărat
          valoare.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3-Step Process -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-yp-black border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-white mb-6 leading-tight text-center"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Cum decurge procesul (în 3 pași simpli)
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-12 h-1 bg-yp-yellow mx-auto mb-16"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
      </div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center mb-24"
      >
        <div data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block">
              PASUL 01 //
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white">
              Consultanță & Audit (Gratuit)
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Analizăm împreună nevoile echipei tale: ce riscuri există, ce bugete
            ai, ce imagine vrei să transmiți. Te ajutăm să identifici ce
            echipamente îți trebuie conform normelor SSM și specificului
            activității.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span>Discutăm cu tine sau cu responsabilul SSM (30-45 min)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                >Identificăm produsele potrivite pentru fiecare rol din echipă</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span>Propunem branding/personalizare dacă este necesar</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 relative"
          data-aos="zoom-in"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-4 border border-dashed border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-center p-6 bg-yp-black/50"
          >
            <span
              class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-widest z-10"
              >[ Spațiu Rezervat Vizual Consultanță ]</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center mb-24"
      >
        <div
          class="order-2 lg:order-1 w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 relative"
          data-aos="zoom-in"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-4 border border-dashed border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-center p-6 bg-yp-black/50"
          >
            <span
              class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-widest z-10"
              >[ Spațiu Rezervat Vizual Testare ]</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2" data-aos="fade-left">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block">
              PASUL 02 //
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white">Testare & Mostre</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Înainte să comanzi pentru toată echipa, îți oferim mostre pentru
            testare în condiții reale. Verifici confortul, mărimile, rezistența
            — pentru ca decizia finală să fie informată, nu la ghici.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span>Livrăm mostre pentru fiecare tip de echipament</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span>Echipa ta le testează direct pe teren</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span>Ajustăm mărimi sau alternative dacă este necesar</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center"
      >
        <div data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block">
              PASUL 03 //
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-white">
              Achiziție & Recurență
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Plasezi comanda finală, livrăm rapid, și păstrăm istoricul
            comenzilor tale pentru reordonări viitoare ușoare. Nu mai cauți
            furnizori de fiecare dată — noi ținem evidența și îți trimitem
            reminder-e.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                >Livrare rapidă (3-7 zile lucrătoare în funcție de stoc)</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                >Salvăm preferințele echipei tale (mărimi, produse,
                personalizări)</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-yp-yellow shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                >Comenzi viitoare în max 10 minute (fără refacerea selecției)</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 relative"
          data-aos="zoom-in"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-4 border border-dashed border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-center p-6 bg-yp-black/50"
          >
            <span
              class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-widest z-10"
              >[ Spațiu Rezervat Vizual Achiziție ]</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us (Differentiators) -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-[#0a0a0a] border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-white mb-6 leading-tight text-center"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        De ce ne aleg clienții noștri
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-12 h-1 bg-yp-yellow mx-auto mb-16"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <!-- Differentiator 1 -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-4"
          >
            01 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white mb-4">
            Partner, nu doar furnizor
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            Nu vindem produse la catalog. Înțelegem afacerea ta și îți oferim
            consultanță pe măsură pentru echipa ta.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Differentiator 2 -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-4"
          >
            02 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white mb-4">
            Identitate vizuală
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            Echipa ta arată profesional, unitar, ca o companie serioasă — nu ca
            o echipă improvizată.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Differentiator 3 -->
        <div
          class="bg-yp-black border border-white/10 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-yp-yellow/30 transition-colors group"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="300"
        >
          <div
            class="text-yp-yellow font-mono text-sm tracking-widest block mb-4"
          >
            03 //
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white mb-4">Predictibilitate</h3>
          <p
            class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors"
          >
            Istoric salvat, reordonare rapidă, reminder-e la timp — niciodată nu
            rămâi fără echipamente.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-yp-yellow relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
      <button
        class="bg-yp-black text-white hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] transition-colors py-6 px-8 lg:px-12 rounded-[4px] shadow-2xl group flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mx-auto w-full md:w-auto"
        onclick="window.YouProtectShortlist?.openLeadModal({ intent: 'free_consultation', source: 'cum_lucram_cta' })"
        data-aos="zoom-in"
      >
        <span class="text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium tracking-wide"
          >Pregătit să ridici standardul echipei tale?</span
        >
        <svg
          class="w-6 h-6 shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform text-yp-yellow"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
        >
      </button>

      <p
        class="mt-8 text-yp-black/80 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        Consultanță gratuită. Răspuns în maximum 24 de ore. Zero presiune. Apasă
        butonul pentru a începe.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
